#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn about managing context-based restrictions to define and enforce "
"restrictions on resources."
msgstr ""
"Pelajari cara mengelola pembatasan berbasis konteks untuk mendefinisikan dan"
" menerapkan pembatasan pada sumber daya."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Protecting Qiskit Runtime Service resources with context-based restrictions"
msgstr ""
"Melindungi sumber daya Qiskit Runtime Service dengan pembatasan berbasis "
"konteks"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Protecting Qiskit Runtime Service resources with context-based restrictions "
"{#protecting-qiskit-runtime-service-resources-with-context-based-"
"restrictions}"
msgstr ""
"Melindungi sumber daya Qiskit Runtime Service dengan pembatasan berbasis "
"konteks {#protecting-qiskit-runtime-service-resources-with-context-based-"
"restrictions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Context-based restrictions give account owners and administrators the "
"ability to define and enforce access restrictions for IBM Cloud&reg; "
"resources based on the context of access requests. Access to Qiskit Runtime "
"Service resources can be controlled with context-based restrictions and "
"identity and access management (IAM) policies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pembatasan berbasis konteks memberi pemilik akun dan administrator kemampuan"
" untuk mendefinisikan dan menerapkan pembatasan akses terhadap sumber daya "
"IBM Cloud&reg; berdasarkan konteks permintaan akses. Akses ke sumber daya "
"Qiskit Runtime Service dapat dikontrol dengan pembatasan berbasis konteks "
"dan kebijakan identity and access management (IAM).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These restrictions work with traditional IAM policies, which are based on "
"identity, to provide an extra layer of protection. Unlike IAM policies, "
"context-based restrictions don't assign access. Context-based restrictions "
"check that an access request comes from an allowed context that you "
"configure. Since both IAM access and context-based restrictions enforce "
"access, context-based restrictions offer protection even in the face of "
"compromised or mismanaged credentials. For more information, see the [What "
"are context-based "
"restrictions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-context-"
"restrictions-whatis) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pembatasan ini bekerja bersama kebijakan IAM tradisional yang berbasis "
"identitas, untuk memberikan lapisan perlindungan tambahan. Tidak seperti "
"kebijakan IAM, pembatasan berbasis konteks tidak memberikan hak akses. "
"Pembatasan berbasis konteks memeriksa apakah permintaan akses berasal dari "
"konteks yang diizinkan sesuai konfigurasi Anda. Karena baik akses IAM maupun"
" pembatasan berbasis konteks sama-sama menerapkan kontrol akses, pembatasan "
"berbasis konteks tetap memberikan perlindungan meskipun kredensial bocor "
"atau salah kelola. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat topik [Apa itu "
"pembatasan berbasis "
"konteks](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-context-"
"restrictions-whatis).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A user must have the Administrator role on the Qiskit Runtime Service "
"service to create, update, or delete rules. A user must also have either the"
" Editor or Administrator role on the Context-based restrictions service to "
"create, update, or delete network zones. A user with the Viewer role on the "
"Context-based restrictions service can only add network zones to a rule.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna harus memiliki peran Administrator pada layanan Qiskit Runtime "
"Service untuk membuat, memperbarui, atau menghapus aturan. Pengguna juga "
"harus memiliki peran Editor atau Administrator pada layanan Context-based "
"restrictions untuk membuat, memperbarui, atau menghapus zona jaringan. "
"Pengguna dengan peran Viewer pada layanan Context-based restrictions hanya "
"dapat menambahkan zona jaringan ke suatu aturan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Any Activity Tracker or audit log events generated come from the context-"
"based restrictions service, not Qiskit Runtime Service. For more "
"information, see the [Monitoring context-based "
"restrictions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-cbr-monitor) "
"page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua peristiwa Activity Tracker atau log audit yang dihasilkan berasal dari"
" layanan context-based restrictions, bukan dari Qiskit Runtime Service. "
"Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat halaman [Memantau pembatasan berbasis "
"konteks](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-cbr-monitor).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To get started protecting your Qiskit Runtime Service resources with "
"context-based restrictions, see the [Leveraging context-based restrictions "
"to secure your resources](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"context-restrictions-tutorial) tutorial.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mulai melindungi sumber daya Qiskit Runtime Service Anda dengan "
"pembatasan berbasis konteks, lihat tutorial [Memanfaatkan pembatasan "
"berbasis konteks untuk mengamankan sumber daya "
"Anda](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-context-restrictions-"
"tutorial).\n"
